                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 31,
                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "More than 75% of Americans have a favorable view of Medicaid, yet the Republican budget plans to slash at least $880 billion in funding to pay for tax breaks for billionaires.\n\nFunding Medicaid has to be a bipartisan priority. We need to protect hospitals from closing and working families from losing insurance.",
