                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 31,
                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Nearly 200 rural hospitals have closed since 2005. Slashing $880 billion from Medicaid will increase rural hospitals' risk of closure by over 50%.\n\nIt\u2019s time to pass Medicare for All and ensure Americans do not\u00a0have their healthcare ripped away.",
