                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": ".@ChrisCuomo Republicans are denying they\u2019ll cut Medicaid coverage but are afraid to go after real waste, fraud, and abuse.\n\nWe need to go after Big Pharma, Medicare Advantage, prescription drug prices, and hospital surcharges, not Americans' healthcare coverage. https://t.co/KTfrTsSED4",
