                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In 2022, over half of nursing home patients relied on Medicaid. Cutting $880B in funding will significantly increase residents\u2019 costs and devastate the lives of our most vulnerable seniors.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nWe must continue to fund healthcare and ensure millions of Americans keep their healthcare coverage.",
