                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In 2024, Medicaid covered nearly 37% of patients in birthing units. Cuts would rip health insurance from many new parents and leave them to pay nearly $19,000 out of pocket for childbirth.\n\nIt's time to do more and pass Medicare for All, so no one has to fear the cost of a hospital visit.",
