                "retweet_count": 138,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I pointed out on @ChrisCuomo that the Republican budget has the largest cuts in Medicaid in the program's history.\n\nThis would close rural hospitals, take away physical therapy and mental healthcare, and deprive millions of healthcare. Don't take my word for it, ask @HawleyMO. https://t.co/9506lkzSJE",
