                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 11,
                "retweet_count": 17,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "From 2019-2021, Medicare Advantage insurers gained $50 billion from diagnosing patients with conditions that were never treated.\u00a0\n\nMy bill, the Save Medicare Act, with @RepMarkPocan and @janschakowsky\u00a0will stop allowing private insurers to use the Medicare name to fleece the American public.",
                "text_lang": "en",
