                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The GOP cuts to healthcare coverage will likely add another $50B in medical debt to the $340B in debt Americans owe. \n\nWe should be helping bring relief to ordinary Americans, not punishing them for seeking care. Let\u2019s pass my bill with @SenSanders to erase medical debt.",
