                "retweet_count": 16,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This bill will mean higher premiums for those on the Affordable Care Act, higher premiums for those with private insurance as hospitals charge them more due to Medicaid cuts, and the shutting down of rural hospitals. https://t.co/yFN6CcJicf",
