                "reply_count": 18,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "More than 150 hospitals have closed since 2010 while another 267 have started to shut down. Trump's budget bill will pull Medicaid funding from hospitals already struggling to stay open.\n\nWe cannot allow this administration to continue taking resources away from ordinary Americans to pay for tax cuts for billionaires.",
